  "strongest_counterargument": "The strongest case against advancing is that organizational activity and README-described capabilities do not establish current core-product momentum or independent production demand. Keep Faremeter on watch until diligence verifies active core maintainers, repeat external usage and a fundable business with a credible way to capture value."
